@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Close with a disposition for every unfinished story
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "SprintBoardPage, SprintsPage, SprintPlanningPage\nor ProjectLayoutPage\nCloseSprintDialog / SprintClosureForm" as page
  participant "ISprintService / SprintService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "SprintsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "CloseSprintCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "Sprint" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Choose Set all and any per-story destinations across pages; confirm Close sprint
page -> client : close(CloseSprintCommand: workspace, sprint, reviewedVersion, setAllTo?, overrides[])\nthe stories without an override take setAllTo
client -> access : POST /api/workspaces/{id}/sprints/{sprintId}/close
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client --> page : SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once; sign in with the sprint board as return route
else Authenticated (profile P: every active role closes sprints)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send CloseSprintCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : Distinct override story IDs; each destination is Backlog or a sprint ID
  alt Malformed destination or duplicate override
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read or changed
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Keep the choices; one error focuses its row's destination select, several focus\nthe error summary; no Retry or reference ID
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle CloseSprintCommand
    handler -> db : BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync (workspace lock); LoadSprintClosureAsync:\nSprint with status, version and memberships, unfinished member IDs,\nnamed destination sprints, active slot, sprint BoardState
    db --> handler : SprintClosure
    alt Sprint not found (or in another workspace)
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
      client --> page : SprintClosureForm emits notFound; the dialog closes with Outdated; the opening page rereads\nand shows its own state
    else Sprint not Active: still Planned, or already Closed (L2-026.3)
      handler --> ctrl : 409 not active, naming the sprint's state; history unchanged
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not active)
      client --> page : already-closed names the actual state ("Sprint 8 is already closed." or "Sprint 9 hasn't started,\nso it can't close.") in the alert region, which describes the dialog; focus moves to View sprints, or to Close when\nofferSprintsLink is false (Sprints tab); no retry; the form emits outdated, so Close returns Outdated and the opening page rereads
    else reviewedVersion differs from the sprint version (L2-025.3, L2-041)
      handler --> ctrl : 409 stale review; nothing changed; no actor, time, or changed rows
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (sprint changed)
      client --> page : conflict: "Sprint 8 changed while you were reviewing. Review the updated list;\nyour choices are kept where they still apply."
      page -> client : Read the review once from page 1; adopt its version
      client --> page : Refreshed page; keep Set all and the overrides of stories still unfinished; no resubmission
    else Override names a story that is not an unfinished member
      handler --> ctrl : 400 identifying the story; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails per story
      client --> page : unresolved presentation: keep choices; the server's reason on that row when it is on the current page;\nno Retry or reference ID
    else No setAllTo and an unfinished story has no override (L2-025.1)
      handler --> ctrl : 400 identifying each unresolved story; sprint stays Active
      ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails per story
      client --> page : Keep choices; one unresolved story on this page focuses its destination select; several focus\nthe error summary, which lists each story and links to rows on this page
    else Destination is not a Planned sprint in this workspace (L2-025.3)
      handler --> ctrl : 400 identifying the story or Set all, and the destination; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
      client --> page : unresolved presentation: keep choices; the reason on that row or on Set all;\nreread the review for current destinations
    else Closure accepted
      handler -> entity : L2-025 close(setAllTo, overrides, unfinishedIds, destinations, at, actorId):\noverride, else setAllTo, for every current unfinished story
      entity --> handler : Closed sprint; SprintSnapshot and SprintStoryOutcome children with actors and destinations;\nmembership children moved; initial scope and scope changes stay as recorded during the sprint
      handler -> db : L2-026 / L2-040 RemoveActiveSprintSlot; RemoveBoardState; AddAuditEvent;\nSaveChangesAsync: set-based writes of tracked membership and outcome children with unchanged status;\nsnapshot header; destination versions increment; success audit; one transaction
      alt Unique open-membership violation (concurrent allocation, L2-041.2)
        db --> handler : Roll back everything
        handler --> ctrl : 409 stale review; sprint stays Active
        ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (sprint changed)
        client --> page : Same neutral message; reread the review; keep choices
      else Commit fails
        db --> handler : Roll back business state and success audit
        handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
        ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-close claim
        client --> page : Failed state with reference ID; sprint still active; choices kept;\nClose sprint retries only when chosen
      else Commit succeeds
        db --> handler : Closed sprint and snapshot
        handler --> ctrl : SprintCloseResult: ID, name, history route, done, returned and carried-over counts
        ctrl --> client : 200 with the close result
        client --> page : Form emits closed; the dialog closes with Closed(SprintCloseResult); the board, Sprints\nor planning page opens sprint history; the layout calls refresh(); the board shows No active sprint
        page --> actor : Every opener, ProjectLayoutPage included, shows the "Sprint 8 closed" toast with the counts through TOAST_SERVICE
      end
    end
  end
end
note over ctrl, db
A workspace lock wait beyond the timeout returns 503 with Retry-After and no change;
the dialog shows the same failed state with the reference ID and keeps every choice.
An unexpected 403 (access changed after sign-in) closes nothing; SprintClosureForm keeps every choice
and emits forbidden, which the dialog relays as its own forbidden while it stays open, and the
opening page shows the "Your access changed" toast through TOAST_SERVICE, without Retry.
A close that gets no response is uncertain: the dialog keeps every choice, says "We couldn't
confirm whether Sprint 8 closed." (no reference ID), and the form emits unconfirmed, which the
dialog relays while it stays open, so the opening page rereads at once. It reads the review once
from page 1: Closed shows the neutral "Sprint 8 is closed now." with View sprints (only when
offerSprintsLink is true) and Close, which
returns Outdated (unconfirmed-closed; never "Nothing changed"); Active shows the refreshed review
with the choices kept.
SaveChangesAsync raises ConcurrencyConflictException on a stale version, mapped to the same 409.
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
